<title>USA: MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</title>
<headline>MGE deliverable HRS wheat stocks.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS, MN 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Minneapolis Grain Exchange reported stocks of hard red spring wheat in deliverable position as of Nov 29, in 000 bushels. Stocks in exchange approved elevators deliverable against MGE futures. Deliverable and non-deliverable grades exclude CCC stocks.</p>
<p>						Nov 29   WEEK    YEAR</p>
<p>							   AGO     AGO</p>
<p>						   MINNEAPOLIS AREA</p>
<p>Deliverable				 1,547   1,397   2,396</p>
<p>Non-deliverable				25	56     725</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     21	21	34</p>
<p>Total					 1,593   1,474   3,155</p>
<p>						   DULUTH/SUPERIOR</p>
<p>Deliverable				 4,179   5,774   6,461</p>
<p>Non-deliverable			     435     413   2,740</p>
<p>CCC stocks				     41	41     995</p>
<p>Total					 4,655   6,228  10,196</p>
<p>Note: Minneapolis area includes Minneapolis/St Paul/Red Wing. (Chicago newsdesk 312 983 7278)</p>
